WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.720
Hygelis begins with specialised safety intelligence, not a generic AI model.

2
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:10.200
Its core advantage comes from understanding drug-event relationships, medical

3
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.860
evidence, historical patterns and the workflows safety teams actually use.

4
00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:18.120
Every qualified investigation can generate feedback.

5
00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:19.600
What evidence mattered?

6
00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:21.200
What evidence did not?

7
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.260
Where was the system uncertain?

8
00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:26.340
Over time, that creates a data flywheel.

9
00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:29.440
Expert validation improves safety intelligence.

10
00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:32.250
Better intelligence improves investigations.

11
00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:34.550
Better investigations build trust.

12
00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.860
And that trust helps Hygelis become part of the safety team's workflow,

13
00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:41.400
evidence systems and audit infrastructure.

14
00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:43.740
The moat doesn't start with lock-in.

15
00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:47.180
It starts with intelligence and grows into infrastructure.
